    "name": "Dancin Divas",
    "steam_appid": 1941370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/e8b31a00da01453e0baafe93ed784442.poster.avif?t=1741151237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/e8b31a00da01453e0baafe93ed784442.webm?t=1741151237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/e8b31a00da01453e0baafe93ed784442.mp4?t=1741151237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A robbery has taken place! Four Diva's from around the world are showcasing their treasures at the local lounge but things have gone south. It's time to fight back! Classic arcade side scrolling beat em up with some sexy character design and radical gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Viva </strong> - The one in blue with the most balanced skills and the power of lightning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/712fb39144681f904daf71e6b14cc43f.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hina</strong> - In the red, she goes for long range attacks and isn't afraid to play with fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/d2003f2571fd705e54f75b15678d8f61.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bahati </strong> - The one in yellow can use their large size and perform quite the wrestling suplexes to break the earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/18083c716809d0110f6558c2cef14925.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sofia</strong> - The shortest, this green one is quick with their moves and agility and fly like the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/1cf623551bbd58aaaeafd5287c64507b.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Play over 16 show stopping levels across the globe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Many level routes! Choose paths for multiple playthroughs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Dozens of combos and hundreds of and animated frame animations inspired by Pizza Tower &amp; AntonBlast! </strong><strong><br>- Minigame Mayhem! Test your Might or drive to victory with many types of gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- In game shop with unlocks, cheats, weapons and more! <br>- Unlock over 70 gallery pics of the Divas. Gawk at the many ladies of Dancin Divas!</strong><strong><br>- Multiplayer mode, bring your best Divas in 4 player mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Voices from the talented MizzPeachy, Mimi Hung, Flirty Fawn, Cinder &amp; SedThePanda!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Classic Midi bop soundtrack by lovely_pantaloons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/02cd83797ce6a6b05ee28159ce7e1658.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/e8b31a00da01453e0baafe93ed784442.poster.avif?t=1741151237\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/e8b31a00da01453e0baafe93ed784442.webm?t=1741151237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/e8b31a00da01453e0baafe93ed784442.mp4?t=1741151237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A robbery has taken place! Four Diva's from around the world are showcasing their treasures at the local lounge but things have gone south. It's time to fight back! Classic arcade side scrolling beat em up with some sexy character design and radical gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Viva </strong> - The one in blue with the most balanced skills and the power of lightning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/712fb39144681f904daf71e6b14cc43f.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hina</strong> - In the red, she goes for long range attacks and isn't afraid to play with fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/d2003f2571fd705e54f75b15678d8f61.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bahati </strong> - The one in yellow can use their large size and perform quite the wrestling suplexes to break the earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/18083c716809d0110f6558c2cef14925.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sofia</strong> - The shortest, this green one is quick with their moves and agility and fly like the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/1cf623551bbd58aaaeafd5287c64507b.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Play over 16 show stopping levels across the globe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Many level routes! Choose paths for multiple playthroughs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Dozens of combos and hundreds of and animated frame animations inspired by Pizza Tower &amp; AntonBlast! </strong><strong><br>- Minigame Mayhem! Test your Might or drive to victory with many types of gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- In game shop with unlocks, cheats, weapons and more! <br>- Unlock over 70 gallery pics of the Divas. Gawk at the many ladies of Dancin Divas!</strong><strong><br>- Multiplayer mode, bring your best Divas in 4 player mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Voices from the talented MizzPeachy, Mimi Hung, Flirty Fawn, Cinder &amp; SedThePanda!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Classic Midi bop soundtrack by lovely_pantaloons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941370/extras/02cd83797ce6a6b05ee28159ce7e1658.avif?t=1741151237\" /></div></p>",
